      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we know what the latency is for powering OTP on/off?\n\nI\u0027m not really worried about it for this function since it is infrequently called, but if it\u0027s slow we may not want to power it on/off in [`get_ikm`](https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/5371373/8/common/fpsensor/fpsensor_crypto.cc). I guess if we merge this and and find that powering it on/off is slow, we could add code in the [RW initialization](https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/baseboard/helipilot/base_board_rw.c;l\u003d40-44;drc\u003d1194cf102149ece9de292c29120416b3e1104314) to leave it on all the time. (I\u0027m just trying to think about the tradeoffs for including include this in RO vs not.)",
