      "side": 1,
      "message": "Using simple profiling code partially borrowed from one of Bobby\u0027s past CLs\n\n{\n\ttimestamp_t t0 \u003d get_time();\n\t/* Power on OTP Memory. */\n\totp_key_init();\n\n\tccprints(\"otp_key_init time: %d\", time_since32(t0));\n}\n\n{\n\ttimestamp_t t1 \u003d get_time();\n\t/* Power off OTP Memory. */\n\totp_key_exit();\n\n\tccprints(\"otp_key_exit time: %d\", time_since32(t1));\n}\n\t\n[1.688198 otp_key_init time: 19] (sometimes 18)\n[1.688263 otp_key_exit time: 2]\n\nSo, about 19 microseconds to power on consistently 2 microseconds to power off",
